{"titulo": "🎓 Edit sin texto único → Read + Write", "demo": "2.5", "dominio": 2, "simulada": false, "fecha": "2026-11-23 12:55", "ajustes": {"D25_TOOLS": ["Read", "Grep", "Glob", "Edit", "Write"], "D25_EDIT_RESPALDO": "read_write", "DETALLE": "basico"}, "lineas": ["🎛  Panel settings for this run: D25_TOOLS = [\"Read\", \"Grep\", \"Glob\", \"Edit\", \"Write\"] · D25_EDIT_RESPALDO = ", "\"read_write\"", "\u001b[2m   Model: claude-haiku-\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;36m5\u001b[0m\u001b[2m-\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;36m5\u001b[0m", "\u001b[2m   HTML mode: on → salidas_html/dominio2/\u001b[0m", "", "\u001b[34m────────────────────────── \u001b[0m\u001b[1;37;48;5;18m DEMO \u001b[0m\u001b[1;37;48;5;18m2.5\u001b[0m\u001b[1;37;48;5;18m · Built-in tools: Grep vs Glob, Read and Edit \u001b[0m\u001b[34m ──────────────────────────\u001b[0m", "", "\u001b[2m📖 This demo's guide: python lab_dominio2.py guia \u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;36m2.5\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  ·  more detail: set DETALLE = \u001b[0m\u001b[2;32m\"completo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[2m at the top of \u001b[0m", "\u001b[2mthe file\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[33m────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m 💡 Exam concept \u001b[0m\u001b[33m─────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─╮\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                            \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  Grep = search INSIDE files (who calls processRefund?).                                                    \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  Glob = search for files by NAME or path (which ones are the *.test.ts?).                                  \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  Read = read a file.  Edit = targeted change with unique text (if it isn't unique, it fails → Read +       \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  Write).                                                                                                   \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  Incremental exploration: first Grep to find entry points, then Read to follow imports (like the           \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  processRefund → submitRefund re-export). Reading the whole repo at once wastes context.                   \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                            \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m", "\u001b[1;32m   ✔ Sample repo created in: \u001b[0m", "\u001b[1;32m$TMP/ccarf_corrida_8zwp0yle/\u001b[0m\u001b[1;32mtiendita_repo_288qgn5c\u001b[0m", "\u001b[3m          Repo files          \u001b[0m", "┌────────────────────────────┐", "│ README.md                  │", "│ config/limites.json        │", "│ src/admin/panel.ts         │", "│ src/carrito/total.ts       │", "│ src/checkout/pago.ts       │", "│ src/reembolsos/index.ts    │", "│ src/reembolsos/procesar.ts │", "│ tests/carrito.test.ts      │", "│ tests/reembolsos.test.ts   │", "└────────────────────────────┘", "\u001b[2m   Trap \u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;36m1\u001b[0m\u001b[2m: index.ts re-exports processRefund as submitRefund, and panel.ts renames it again.\u001b[0m", "\u001b[2m   Trap \u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;36m2\u001b[0m\u001b[2m: in limites.json the value \u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;36m10000\u001b[0m\u001b[2m appears TWICE: an Edit of just \u001b[0m\u001b[2;32m'10000'\u001b[0m\u001b[2m isn't unique.\u001b[0m", "\u001b[2m   built-in tools enabled: \u001b[0m\u001b[1;2m[\u001b[0m\u001b[2;32m'Read'\u001b[0m\u001b[2m, \u001b[0m\u001b[2;32m'Grep'\u001b[0m\u001b[2m, \u001b[0m\u001b[2;32m'Glob'\u001b[0m\u001b[2m, \u001b[0m\u001b[2;32m'Edit'\u001b[0m\u001b[2m, \u001b[0m\u001b[2;32m'Write'\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2m]\u001b[0m\u001b[2m   ·   cwd: \u001b[0m", "\u001b[2;35m$TMP/ccarf_corrida_8zwp0yle/\u001b[0m\u001b[2;95mtiendita_repo_288qgn5c\u001b[0m", "", "\u001b[1;35m→ Agent SDK \u001b[0m\u001b[1;35m(\u001b[0m\u001b[1;35mexplore repo\u001b[0m\u001b[1;35m)\u001b[0m prompt: Trabajas en el repo de La Tiendita que está en ", "\u001b[35m$TMP/ccarf_corrida_8zwp0yle/\u001b[0m\u001b[95mtiendita_repo_288qgn5c\u001b[0m", "\u001b[1;36m1\u001b[0m\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m Encuentra TODOS los archivos de código que usan la función processRefund, incluyendo donde se usa con otro ", "nombre \u001b[1m(\u001b[0malias o re-export\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m.", "\u001b[1;36m2\u001b[0m\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m Lista los archivos de pruebas \u001b[1m(\u001b[0m*.test.ts\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m.", "\u001b[1;36m3\u001b[0m\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m En config/limites.json cambia SOLO el límite de reembolso de \u001b[1;36m10000\u001b[0m a \u001b[1;36m8000\u001b[0m. No toques el límite de crédito.", "Responde al final con una lista corta de archivos para \u001b[1;36m1\u001b[0m\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m y \u001b[1;36m2\u001b[0m\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m.", "Para el paso \u001b[1;36m3\u001b[0m haz primero un Edit con old_string exactamente \u001b[32m\"10000\"\u001b[0m. Si falla porque el texto no es único, ", "NO amplíes old_string: lee el archivo completo con Read y reescríbelo completo con Write.", "\u001b[2m   session started · \u001b[0m\u001b[2;33msession_id\u001b[0m\u001b[2m=\u001b[0m\u001b[2;93m80d75c13\u001b[0m\u001b[2;93m-25dd-468c-8177-4e9167ef5360\u001b[0m\u001b[2m · \u001b[0m\u001b[2;33mmodel\u001b[0m\u001b[2m=\u001b[0m\u001b[2;35mclaude\u001b[0m\u001b[2m-haiku-\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;36m5\u001b[0m\u001b[2m-\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;36m5\u001b[0m", "\u001b[2m   available tools: Edit, Glob, Grep, Read, Write\u001b[0m", "\u001b[2m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1;2m(\u001b[0m\u001b[2mthinking hidden\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2m)\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[33m────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m tool_use → Grep \u001b[0m\u001b[33m─────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─╮\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m{\u001b[0m                                                                                                          \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;34m\"pattern\"\u001b[0m: \u001b[32m\"processRefund\"\u001b[0m,                                                                              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;34m\"path\"\u001b[0m: \u001b[32m\"$TMP/ccarf_corrida_8zwp0yle/tiendita_repo_2\u001b[0m \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;34m\"output_mode\"\u001b[0m: \u001b[32m\"content\"\u001b[0m,                                                                                \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;34m\"-n\"\u001b[0m: \u001b[3;92mtrue\u001b[0m                                                                                               \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m}\u001b[0m                                                                                                          \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m", "\u001b[35m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[35m───────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[35m 🪝 call #1 \u001b[0m\u001b[35m───────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[35m─╮\u001b[0m", "\u001b[35m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1mGrep\u001b[0m: busca CONTENIDO dentro de archivos (nombres de funciones, imports, mensajes de error)                \u001b[35m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[35m│\u001b[0m input: {\"pattern\": \"processRefund\", \"path\":                                                                \u001b[35m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[35m│\u001b[0m \"$TMP/ccarf_corrida_8zwp0yle/tiendita_repo_288qgn5c\",  \u001b[35m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[35m│\u001b[0m \"output_mode\": \"content\", \"-n\": true}                                                                      \u001b[35m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[35m╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m", "\u001b[36m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[36m──────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[36m tool_result \u001b[0m\u001b[36m───────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[36m─╮\u001b[0m", "\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m src/reembolsos/index.ts:2:export { processRefund as submitRefund } from './procesar';                      \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m src/reembolsos/procesar.ts:3:export function processRefund(orderId: string, amount: number): boolean {     \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m tests/reembolsos.test.ts:1:import { processRefund } from '../src/reembolsos/procesar';                     \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m tests/reembolsos.test.ts:2:test('rechaza montos altos', () => { expect(() => processRefund('#1',           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m 99999)).toThrow(); });                                                                                     \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[36m╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[33m────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m tool_use → Glob \u001b[0m\u001b[33m─────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─╮\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m{\u001b[0m                                                                                                          \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;34m\"pattern\"\u001b[0m: \u001b[32m\"**/*.test.ts\"\u001b[0m,                                                                               \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;34m\"path\"\u001b[0m: \u001b[32m\"$TMP/ccarf_corrida_8zwp0yle/tiendita_repo_2\u001b[0m \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m}\u001b[0m                                            